                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare me oro abaka Nebukadnejar ocwao omiro mere me wot kele i Babulon, kun okelo daŋ jami mogo abeco me tic i ot a Rwot. Ote lunyo keto ominnere Jedekia me bedo abaka ame loo Juda kede Jerucalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
