              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28.1-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jedekia ocako loc ame mwaka me dittere oromo pyeraryo wie acel, en te bedo loc i Jerucalem mwakki apar wie acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En obedo timo gin anen arac i nyim Rwot Obaŋa mere. En mom oye bedo amwol baŋ Jeremia adwarpiny, ame obedo kobbe kop ame oya ibaŋ Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.17.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ejek. 17.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En daŋ ojem i kom Nebukadnejar abaka me Babulon, ame rik onwoŋo omie ekwoŋo akwoŋa kun ekwoŋo i nyiŋ Obaŋa; en odoko apala ame mom doŋ twero ŋut me lokere dok baŋ Rwot Obaŋa me Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olamdog adoŋo luŋ karacel kede lwak luŋ onwoŋo doŋ ogak oko odoco, ame otimo doŋ timmogo me kwer calo rok ocele, kun daŋ obalo doŋ ot a Rwot ame Rwot onwoŋo olonyo me bedo kabedo acil i Jerucalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
