          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I mwaka me agege me loc abaka Kuro me Pacia, i mwaka-nono en ame Rwot obin otugo iye cunye en abaka Kuro me cwalo cik romo lobo mere luŋ kun daŋ mio ocoo acoa me kwan rom lobo mere luŋ. Man otimere me kop a rik Rwot omio Jeremia okobo cobere kakare, Koppere-nono rik ocoo ni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
