              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Man en gin ame Kuro abaka me Pacia okobo. Rwot ame obedo Obaŋa me polo doŋ otyeko keta me bedo aloc me wi podo luŋ, dok omia tic me gero ot pire i Jerucalem i Juda. Doŋ Rwot Obaŋa myero bed i ŋat acel acel i kom jo mere luŋ ame tye i akinawu; omi en wot i Jerucalem kuno.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.23"
            ]
